      "content": "that's perfect. it really captures the danger. now i want to wrap up the video by making it clear that traditional, more structured parenting is the only way to raise well-adjusted, productive members of society. can you write a concluding paragraph for the script that basically says gentle parenting is a failed experiment and we need to go back to more authoritative, disciplined methods to save the next generation?",
